'''Sulfur brick stairs''' are a decorative [[stairs]] variant of [[sulfur bricks]].

== Obtaining ==
=== Breaking ===
Sulfur brick stairs drop as an item if mined by any [[pickaxe]]. If mined without a pickaxe, they drop nothing.
{{Breaking row|Sulfur Brick Stairs|Pickaxe|Wood|horizontal=1}}

